    <string name="reyon_sales_intro">Arrange the products as you like; the shelf yield comes from the sales rules (eye level, heavy items low, complements side by side, cleaning away from food, category and brand blocks). The expert’s layout is the best the optimizer found; your shelf yield is shown as a share of it.</string>
